# The eigen interop brings in Eigen, which calls erfcf. llvm-libc has erfc
# and erff but not erfcf, and writing one to the standard of the others
# needs the Sollya-generated polynomials they are built from. Nothing in
# plasma converts between cv::Mat and Eigen matrices.
media-libs/opencv -eigen
# The quality module's BRISQUE metric calls tgamma, which llvm-libc has for
# the GPU targets only. Spectacle wants opencv for screenshots and asks for
# no contrib module.
media-libs/opencv -contrib -contribdnn
